    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806780/extras/864cb895214c0cacf44d407e61c8e666.avif?t=1752519111\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasked with being a security guard at different facilities you will have a few friends with you to make sure everything goes smoothly. Once you have rounded up the best security team and chosen which facility you will tackle that night it is time to put your best teamwork skills together. First in order to communicate there will be two main ways, the first being proximity voice chat, and the second being walkie talkies for talking over long distances. Then you will want to assign who does what, there are many things you will have to do in order to complete your shift. One of the most important aspects of a security crew is the cameras. You will want to make sure you always have someone on the camera to guide players to the generator and protect them from monsters that may be in the crew's path. So if you're not watching over the crew from the cameras then you will be tasked with finding the generator and protecting the office from threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806780/extras/4f70f879dba8ca93dcfe29deb1ab81d4.avif?t=1752519111\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to survive the night you should protect the power and survive until the morning. Every facility will have power and can be sabotaged, so you need to protect the power. On top of power and time there will also be vicious creatures lurking places, so watch your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806780/extras/98ceaeefc5da21f08f54b4084dad97c1.avif?t=1752519111\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span>You must protect the facility by fighting off any threats that come to the facility, this could be monsters or even a power outage in an area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806780/extras/864cb895214c0cacf44d407e61c8e666.avif?t=1752519111\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasked with being a security guard at different facilities you will have a few friends with you to make sure everything goes smoothly. Once you have rounded up the best security team and chosen which facility you will tackle that night it is time to put your best teamwork skills together. First in order to communicate there will be two main ways, the first being proximity voice chat, and the second being walkie talkies for talking over long distances. Then you will want to assign who does what, there are many things you will have to do in order to complete your shift. One of the most important aspects of a security crew is the cameras. You will want to make sure you always have someone on the camera to guide players to the generator and protect them from monsters that may be in the crew's path. So if you're not watching over the crew from the cameras then you will be tasked with finding the generator and protecting the office from threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806780/extras/4f70f879dba8ca93dcfe29deb1ab81d4.avif?t=1752519111\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to survive the night you should protect the power and survive until the morning. Every facility will have power and can be sabotaged, so you need to protect the power. On top of power and time there will also be vicious creatures lurking places, so watch your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806780/extras/98ceaeefc5da21f08f54b4084dad97c1.avif?t=1752519111\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span>You must protect the facility by fighting off any threats that come to the facility, this could be monsters or even a power outage in an area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Security Crew is a first person co-op survival horror game for 1-6 players. As a night shift security guard stationed at abstract, high risk locations, your mission is simply to survive through the night alive.",
